B.buF=s(["Actualizaci\xf3n 2.6.0","P\xe1gina {0} de {1}","Siguiente","Atr\xe1s","Jugar","Crece con cartas","Elige 1 de 3 cada 2 temporadas","Las cartas de crecimiento sustituyen a entrenadores, especialidades y planes de crecimiento. Cada dos temporadas, elige una de tres cartas en pretemporada para desarrollar a tu jugador.","Hay cuatro rarezas: Com\xfan, Rara, \xc9pica y \xdanica. Dos usos de Repetici\xf3n gratis te permiten ver otras cartas. El crecimiento autom\xe1tico sigue igual.","Las carreras en curso pasar\xe1n a cartas en su pr\xf3xima pretemporada. Los pagos anticipados a entrenadores se devolver\xe1n como fondos del propietario.","Un personaje que te represente","21 personajes de due\xf1o","En la pesta\xf1a Due\xf1o, abre Personajes, toca uno que tengas y pulsa Elegir representante. Tu representante aparecer\xe1 en la pantalla de inicio.","Consigue personajes en la tienda, con niveles de due\xf1o, recompensas de temporada y ventajas de productos. Tambi\xe9n puedes usarlos como apariencia del jugador en una nueva carrera.","Los personajes incluidos con productos que ya compraste estar\xe1n disponibles al actualizar.","Recompensas de temporada como regalos","1.\xba: 900 de oro \xb7 10 boletos de repetici\xf3n","Los 3 primeros de la temporada de clasificaci\xf3n ganan oro y boletos de repetici\xf3n; el mejor 10% gana boletos de repetici\xf3n. Al acabar la temporada, entra y pulsa Recibir en la ventana de regalos.","Tu primer podio y tu primer puesto tambi\xe9n te dan un personaje exclusivo de temporada.","Si quedaste entre los 3 primeros o el mejor 10% de una temporada pasada, tambi\xe9n puedes recibir esos premios ahora.","Recibir y empezar","Tus recompensas de temporada: {0}"],t.s)
B.b6L=s(["Atualiza\xe7\xe3o 2.6.0","P\xe1gina {0} de {1}","Pr\xf3ximo","Voltar","Jogar","Cres\xe7a com cartas","Escolha 1 de 3 a cada 2 temporadas","As cartas de crescimento substituem treinadores, especialidades e planos de crescimento. A cada duas temporadas, escolha uma de tr\xeas cartas na pr\xe9-temporada para desenvolver seu jogador.","As raridades s\xe3o Comum, Rara, \xc9pica e \xdanica. Duas op\xe7\xf5es de Nova rolagem gr\xe1tis permitem ver outras cartas. O crescimento autom\xe1tico continua igual.","Carreiras em andamento passar\xe3o \xe0s cartas na pr\xf3xima pr\xe9-temporada. Valores pagos antecipadamente a treinadores ser\xe3o devolvidos como fundos do propriet\xe1rio.","Um personagem para te representar","21 personagens de dono","Na aba Dono, abra Personagens, toque em um que voc\xea tenha e escolha Definir representante. Ele aparecer\xe1 na tela inicial.","Consiga personagens na loja, nos n\xedveis de dono, nas recompensas da temporada e nos benef\xedcios de produtos. Voc\xea tamb\xe9m pode us\xe1-los como visual do jogador em uma nova carreira.","Os personagens de produtos que voc\xea j\xe1 comprou ficam dispon\xedveis assim que atualizar.","Recompensas da temporada em presentes","1\xba: 900 de ouro \xb7 10 bilhetes de nova rolagem","Os 3 primeiros da temporada do ranking ganham ouro e bilhetes de nova rolagem; o top 10% ganha bilhetes de nova rolagem. Ap\xf3s o fim da temporada, entre e toque em Receber na janela de presentes.","Seu primeiro p\xf3dio e seu primeiro lugar tamb\xe9m rendem um personagem exclusivo da temporada.","Se ficou entre os 3 primeiros ou no top 10% de uma temporada passada, esses pr\xeamios tamb\xe9m est\xe3o \xe0 sua espera.","Receber e come\xe7ar","Suas recompensas da temporada: {0}"],t.s)
B.bjY=s(["Mise \xe0 jour 2.6.0","Page {0} sur {1}","Suivant","Retour","Jouer","Grandissez avec des cartes","1 carte sur 3 toutes les 2 saisons","Les cartes de croissance remplacent entra\xeeneurs, sp\xe9cialit\xe9s et plans de croissance. Toutes les deux saisons, choisissez une carte sur trois en pr\xe9saison pour d\xe9velopper votre joueur.","Quatre raret\xe9s : Commune, Rare, \xc9pique et Unique. Deux utilisations du Tirage gratuit permettent de voir d\u2019autres cartes. La croissance automatique reste inchang\xe9e.","Les carri\xe8res en cours passeront aux cartes \xe0 la prochaine pr\xe9saison. Les frais d\u2019entra\xeeneur pay\xe9s d\u2019avance seront rembours\xe9s en fonds de propri\xe9taire.","Un personnage pour vous repr\xe9senter","21 personnages de propri\xe9taire","Dans l\u2019onglet Propri\xe9taire, ouvrez Personnages, touchez un personnage poss\xe9d\xe9 puis Choisir ce personnage. Votre repr\xe9sentant appara\xeet sur l\u2019accueil.","Obtenez des personnages en boutique, via les niveaux de propri\xe9taire, les r\xe9compenses de saison et les avantages des produits. Vous pouvez aussi les choisir comme apparence dans une nouvelle carri\xe8re.","Les personnages offerts avec vos produits d\xe9j\xe0 achet\xe9s sont disponibles d\xe8s la mise \xe0 jour.","Les r\xe9compenses de saison en cadeaux","1er : 900 or \xb7 10 tickets de relance","Le top 3 de la saison de classement gagne de l\u2019or et des tickets de relance, et le top 10% des tickets de relance. Apr\xe8s la fin de saison, connectez-vous et appuyez sur R\xe9cup\xe9rer dans la fen\xeatre de cadeaux.","Votre premier podium et votre premi\xe8re victoire offrent aussi un personnage exclusif \xe0 la saison.","Si vous avez fini dans le top 3 ou le top 10% d\u2019une saison pass\xe9e, ces r\xe9compenses vous attendent aussi.","R\xe9cup\xe9rer et commencer","Vos r\xe9compenses de saison : {0}"],t.s)
B.bpZ=s(["Update 2.6.0","Seite {0} von {1}","Weiter","Zur\xfcck","Spielen","Wachse mit Karten","Alle 2 Saisons 1 aus 3 w\xe4hlen","Wachstumskarten ersetzen Trainer, Spezialisierungen und Wachstumspl\xe4ne. W\xe4hle alle zwei Saisons in der Saisonvorbereitung eine von drei Karten f\xfcr deinen Spieler.","Es gibt vier Seltenheiten: Gew\xf6hnlich, Selten, Episch und Einzigartig. Zweimal Gratis-Neuwurf zeigt dir andere Karten. Das automatische Wachstum bleibt wie bisher.","Laufende Karrieren wechseln in der n\xe4chsten Saisonvorbereitung zu Karten. Vorausbezahlte Trainergeb\xfchren erh\xe4ltst du als Besitzerguthaben zur\xfcck.","Ein Charakter, der dich vertritt","21 Besitzercharaktere","\xd6ffne im Tab Besitzer den Bereich Charaktere, tippe auf einen eigenen Charakter und dann auf Als Vertreter w\xe4hlen. Er erscheint auf deiner Startseite.","Sammle Charaktere im Shop, durch Besitzerlevel, Saisonbelohnungen und Produktboni. Du kannst sie auch als Spielerdesign in einer neuen Karriere w\xe4hlen.","Bonuscharaktere bereits gekaufter Produkte erh\xe4ltst du direkt nach dem Update.","Saisonbelohnungen als Geschenke","Platz 1: 900 Gold \xb7 10 Neuwurf-Tickets","Die Top 3 der Ranglistensaison erhalten Gold und Neuwurf-Tickets, die Top 10% erhalten Neuwurf-Tickets. \xd6ffne nach Saisonende das Spiel und tippe im Geschenkfenster auf Abholen.","Dein erster Podestplatz und dein erster Sieg bringen dir auch einen saisonexklusiven Charakter.","Warst du in einer fr\xfcheren Saison unter den Top 3 oder Top 10%, warten auch diese Belohnungen auf dich.","Abholen und starten","Deine Saisonbelohnungen: {0}"],t.s)
B.bFY=s(["Aggiornamento 2.6.0","Pagina {0} di {1}","Avanti","Indietro","Gioca","Cresci con le carte","Scegli 1 carta su 3 ogni 2 stagioni","Le carte di crescita sostituiscono allenatori, specialit\xe0 e piani di crescita. Ogni due stagioni, scegli una carta su tre nel precampionato per sviluppare il giocatore.","Le rarit\xe0 sono Comune, Rara, Epica e Unica. Due usi di Rilancio gratis permettono di vedere altre carte. La crescita automatica resta invariata.","Le carriere in corso passeranno alle carte dal prossimo precampionato. Le spese anticipate per gli allenatori saranno rimborsate come fondi del proprietario.","Un personaggio che ti rappresenta","21 personaggi del proprietario","Nella scheda Proprietario, apri Personaggi, toccane uno che possiedi e premi Scegli rappresentante. Il tuo rappresentante apparir\xe0 nella home.","Ottieni personaggi dal negozio, dai livelli del proprietario, dai premi stagionali e dai vantaggi dei prodotti. Puoi anche sceglierli come aspetto del giocatore in una nuova carriera.","I personaggi inclusi nei prodotti gi\xe0 acquistati saranno tuoi appena aggiorni.","Premi stagionali in regalo","1\xba: 900 oro \xb7 10 biglietti rilancio","I primi 3 della stagione in classifica ricevono oro e biglietti rilancio, il top 10% riceve biglietti rilancio. A stagione conclusa, accedi e tocca Riscatta nella finestra dei regali.","Il tuo primo podio e il tuo primo posto regalano anche un personaggio esclusivo della stagione.","Se eri tra i primi 3 o nel top 10% di una stagione passata, anche quei premi ti aspettano.","Riscatta e inizia","I tuoi premi stagionali: {0}"],t.s)
B.b3c=s(["Pembaruan 2.6.0","Halaman {0} dari {1}","Lanjut","Kembali","Mulai main","Berkembang dengan kartu","Pilih 1 dari 3 tiap 2 musim","Kartu pertumbuhan menggantikan pelatih, spesialisasi, dan rencana pertumbuhan. Tiap dua musim, pilih satu dari tiga kartu saat pramusim untuk mengembangkan pemainmu.","Kelangkaannya: Umum, Langka, Epik, dan Unik. Dua kali Acak ulang gratis memberimu pilihan kartu lain. Pertumbuhan otomatis tetap seperti biasa.","Karier yang berjalan beralih ke kartu pada pramusim berikutnya. Biaya pelatih yang dibayar di muka dikembalikan sebagai dana pemilik.","Karakter yang mewakilimu","21 karakter pemilik","Di tab Pemilik, buka Karakter, ketuk karakter milikmu lalu pilih Jadikan perwakilan. Karakter itu akan tampil di beranda.","Kumpulkan karakter dari toko, level pemilik, hadiah musim, dan bonus produk. Kamu juga bisa memilihnya sebagai tampilan pemain di karier baru.","Karakter bonus dari produk yang sudah kamu beli langsung tersedia setelah pembaruan.","Hadiah musim masuk kotak hadiah","Peringkat 1: 900 emas \xb7 10 tiket acak ulang","3 besar musim peringkat mendapat emas dan tiket acak ulang, sedangkan 10% teratas mendapat tiket acak ulang. Setelah musim berakhir, masuk ke game dan ketuk Ambil di popup hadiah.","Saat pertama kali naik podium atau menjadi juara, kamu juga mendapat karakter khusus musim.","Jika pernah masuk 3 besar atau 10% teratas musim lalu, hadiah itu juga menunggumu.","Ambil dan mulai","Hadiah musimmu: {0}"],t.s)
B.bA5=s(["2.6.0 g\xfcncellemesi","Sayfa {0} / {1}","\u0130leri","Geri","Oyna","Kartlarla geli\u015f","Her 2 sezonda 3 karttan 1\u2019ini se\xe7","Geli\u015fim kartlar\u0131 antren\xf6rlerin, uzmanl\u0131klar\u0131n ve geli\u015fim planlar\u0131n\u0131n yerini al\u0131yor. Her iki sezonda bir sezon \xf6ncesinde \xfc\xe7 karttan birini se\xe7erek oyuncunu geli\u015ftir.","Nadirlikler: Yayg\u0131n, Nadir, Epik ve E\u015fsiz. \u0130ki kez \xdccretsiz yenileme ile ba\u015fka kartlar g\xf6rebilirsin. Otomatik geli\u015fim ayn\u0131 kal\u0131r.","Devam eden kariyerler sonraki sezon \xf6ncesinde kartlara ge\xe7er. \xd6nceden \xf6dedi\u011fin antren\xf6r \xfccretleri sahip fonu olarak iade edilir.","Seni temsil edecek bir karakter","21 sahip karakteri","Sahip sekmesinde Karakterler\u2019i a\xe7, sahip oldu\u011fun bir karaktere dokun ve \u201cTemsilci se\xe7\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesine bas. Temsilcin ana sayfada g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.","Ma\u011fazadan, sahip seviyelerinden, sezon \xf6d\xfcllerinden ve \xfcr\xfcn avantajlar\u0131ndan karakter topla. Yeni kariyerinde oyuncu g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc olarak da se\xe7ebilirsin.","Daha \xf6nce ald\u0131\u011f\u0131n \xfcr\xfcnlerin bonus karakterleri g\xfcnceller g\xfcncellemez senindir.","Sezon \xf6d\xfclleri hediye olarak gelir","1.: 900 alt\u0131n \xb7 10 yeniden at\u0131\u015f bileti","S\u0131ralama sezonunun ilk 3\u2019\xfc alt\u0131n ve yeniden at\u0131\u015f bileti, ilk %10\u2019u yeniden at\u0131\u015f bileti kazan\u0131r. Sezon bitince oyuna gir ve hediye penceresinde Al\u2019a dokun.","\u0130lk podyumun ve ilk birincili\u011fin, sezona \xf6zel bir karakter de getirir.","Ge\xe7mi\u015f bir sezonu ilk 3\u2019te veya ilk %10\u2019da bitirdiysen o \xf6d\xfcller de seni bekliyor.","Al ve ba\u015fla","Sezon \xf6d\xfcllerin: {0}"],t.s)
B.bus=s(["\u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062b 2.6.0","\u0627\u0644\u0635\u0641\u062d\u0629 {0} \u0645\u0646 {1}","\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0627\u0644\u064a","\u0627\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0628\u0642","\u0627\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628","\u062a\u0637\u0648\u0651\u0631 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0627\u062a","\u0627\u062e\u062a\u0631 1 \u0645\u0646 3 \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645\u064a\u0646","\u062a\u062d\u0644 \u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0648 \u0645\u062d\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u0635\u0635\u0627\u062a \u0648\u062e\u0637\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0648. \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645\u064a\u0646\u060c \u0627\u062e\u062a\u0631 \u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u062b\u0644\u0627\u062b \u062e\u0644\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0636\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0644\u062a\u0637\u0648\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0627\u0639\u0628\u0643.","\u062f\u0631\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0627\u062a: \u0639\u0627\u062f\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0646\u0627\u062f\u0631\u0629\u060c \u0645\u0644\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0641\u0631\u064a\u062f\u0629. \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0643 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0631\u0645\u064a \u0645\u062c\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u064a\u0646 \u0644\u0631\u0624\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0627\u062a \u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649. \u064a\u0628\u0642\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0645\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a \u0643\u0645\u0627 \u0643\u0627\u0646.","\u062a\u062a\u062d\u0648\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0627\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u0627\u062a \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0636\u064a\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u062f\u0645. \u062a\u064f\u0631\u062f \u0631\u0633\u0648\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0631\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0628\u0642\u0629 \u0643\u0623\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0644 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0644\u0643.","\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u062a\u0645\u062b\u0644\u0643","21 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0644\u0643","\u0641\u064a \u062a\u0628\u0648\u064a\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0644\u0643\u060c \u0627\u0641\u062a\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0648\u0627\u0636\u063a\u0637 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u062a\u0645\u0644\u0643\u0647\u0627 \u062b\u0645 \u062a\u0639\u064a\u064a\u0646 \u0643\u0645\u0645\u062b\u0644. \u062a\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0645\u062b\u0644\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0627\u0634\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0626\u064a\u0633\u064a\u0629.","\u0627\u062c\u0645\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u062c\u0631 \u0648\u0645\u0633\u062a\u0648\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0644\u0643 \u0648\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0641\u0622\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0648\u0645\u0632\u0627\u064a\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a. \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0643 \u0623\u064a\u0636\u064b\u0627 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u0638\u0647\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u0627\u0639\u0628\u0643 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0629 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f\u0629.","\u062a\u062d\u0635\u0644 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0645\u0632\u0627\u064a\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u0627\u0634\u062a\u0631\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0633\u0627\u0628\u0642\u064b\u0627 \u0641\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062b.","\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0641\u0622\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u062a\u0635\u0644\u0643 \u0643\u0647\u062f\u0627\u064a\u0627","\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644: 900 \u0630\u0647\u0628 \xb7 10 \u062a\u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0631\u0645\u064a","\u064a\u062d\u0635\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0644\u0627\u062b\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0627\u0626\u0644 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0635\u0646\u064a\u0641 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0630\u0647\u0628 \u0648\u062a\u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0631\u0645\u064a\u060c \u0648\u0623\u0641\u0636\u0644 10% \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0630\u0627\u0643\u0631. \u0628\u0639\u062f \u0646\u0647\u0627\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645\u060c \u0627\u0641\u062a\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0636\u063a\u0637 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0641\u064a \u0646\u0627\u0641\u0630\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u064a\u0629.","\u0635\u0639\u0648\u062f\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0635\u0629 \u0648\u0641\u0648\u0632\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0643\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644 \u064a\u0645\u0646\u062d\u0627\u0646\u0643 \u0623\u064a\u0636\u064b\u0627 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u062d\u0635\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645.","\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0641\u0622\u062a \u0623\u0641\u0636\u0644 3 \u0648\u0623\u0641\u0636\u0644 10% \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0628\u0642\u0629 \u0645\u062a\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0644\u0643 \u0623\u064a\u0636\u064b\u0627.","\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0648\u0628\u062f\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628","\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0641\u0622\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0643: {0}"],t.s)
